SUMMARY:Argentine Film Festival Supported by The Miracle Theater Foundation
LOCATION:The Miracle Theater\, Inglewood
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 25th 4pm PEPITA\, LA PISTOLERA Argentina. 103m. Dir. Luc
 
ia Puenzo. Set in Mar del Plata during the winter of 1985. It follows the l
 
ife of Margarita Di Tullio\, a sex worker and expectant mother who confront
 
s exploitation rings\, local mafias\, and corrupt police. The plot takes on
 
 historical significance when she defends herself and kills three criminals
 
 who break into her home a real-life event that turns her into one of the m
 
ost famous and controversial figures in the Argentine underworld. Sunday 25
 
th 7pm LO DEJAMOS ACA Argentina. 98m. Dir. Hernan Goldfrid. A pragmatic psy
 
choanalyst\, disillusioned with traditional methods\, begins to cross ethic
 
al boundaries with his patients until he takes on a new patient: a writer s
 
uffering from writer's block and alcohol problems. Tickets & info: https://
 
